{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32520","headline":"上马叹 · 刘驾","name":"上马叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羸马行迟迟，顽童去我远。\n时时一回顾，不觉白日晚。\n路傍豪家宅，楼上红妆满。\n十月庭花开，花前吹玉管。\n君当未贵日，岂不常屯蹇。\n如何见布衣，忽若尘入眼。\n布衣岂常贱，世事车轮转。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}